  "details": "On the new Main menu when going to worlds by default it opens up 'Trending'. Where this is fine, I guess. Though with the current system as you will know most of the same worlds end up showing here (When we want more discoverability).\nI think it would be a good idea especially for first time users as by default when opening the world menu to have Spotlight as the defaulted shown worlds. \nWorlds that have been picked for spotlight should mean \"This is the latest, best offerings\" Which means you have much more control over the first time users experience, highlighting cool worlds with weekly/fortnightly updates.\nI also think this will make VRChat look a bit more professionally organised.\nBelow spotlight could be 'Trending' and then so forth as it is now from there on is fine.",
